# Build context for apps/server/Dockerfile (built from the repo root). Keep it
# hermetic: the image runs its own `pnpm install`, so host node_modules (pnpm
# symlink farms, .vite caches) must never be COPYed over it.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
.git
.claude
.design-pass
apps/client/test-results
apps/client/playwright-report
